  "solution": {
    "text": "Put <math> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow> </math> in the equation of circle to get the point of contact,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mtext>y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Hence, equation of the pair of tangents is<br /><br />&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mo>y</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>8</mn> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>6</mn> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mtext>y</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>8</mn> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mn>8</mn> <msup> <mtext>y</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>8</mn> <msup> <mtext>y</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mn>2</mn> <mn>9</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0002_e155a368a135.jpg\" style=\"width: 232px; height: 183px;\" />"
  }
